abstract: >
  Portable agent-led GitHub repository and SEO discoverability workflows through
  a Python command interface and the cto-legends router. Supports repository
  audits, README improvements, licensing review, metadata, live DataForSEO
  search research, community health, releases, portfolio presentation, and
  social-preview upload preparation and verification.
